    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_GRAND_ORDER_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]World spell, once a game: Grand Order.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Every city of yours completes its current build at once: a unit, or a building that is not a wonder. Rituals are not affected.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]At most 10 turns of the city's own production: a build that needs more gets 10 turns of production toward it.",
